# __NAME__

Rules for `worlds/__ID__/` (made by `tools/new_world`). Write each rule the
world adds here as it is built, the way the other files in `docs/systems/`
do, and keep DESIGN.md's section for the world in step.

- __NAME__ (DESIGN.md, add its section): what it is and what is at stake.
  Its map is open ground on a `Terrain` (`worlds/__ID__/map.gd`): players
  land at the south edge inside a gate outpost, strongpoints hold the
  middle and a warlord the core (`zone_at`, `MIDDLE_FROM_Z`,
  `CORE_FROM_Z`). Its enemies are the roster (`ROSTER` in
  `worlds/__ID__/world.gd`), one row a kind, built by `equip_bot`. Check
  it with `tests/__ID___tests.gd` and by eye with
  `visual_check.tscn -- <dir> --__ID__-only`.
